{
  "title": { "zh": "塞一个 0", "en": "Slip in a 0" },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "把交来的字节一帧一帧地送出：每帧前后各加旗标 01111110，内容里每连着 5 个 1 就多说一个 0。一帧只在「发送」为 1 的拍开始，两帧之间线上是 0。「下一个」为 1 的那一拍取走眼前的字节，「末字节」说明它是不是这一帧的最后一个。",
    "en": "Send the bytes handed to you frame by frame: the flag 01111110 at each end of a frame, and a 0 added after every five 1s in its content. A frame begins only on a tick send is 1, and the wire is 0 between frames. Saying next takes the byte in front of you; last says whether it ends its frame."
  },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "旗标标出一帧从哪开始、到哪结束。可一帧的内容本身也可能含有 01111110：收的一方会把它当成旗标，一帧被从中间切断。于是两头再约好一条：内容里每连着 5 个 1，发送方就多说一个 0，收的一方再把它去掉，内容里就永远不会出现旗标。",
        "en": "Flags mark where a frame begins and ends. But a frame's content may itself hold 01111110: the receiver takes it for a flag and the frame is cut in two. So the ends agree on one more rule: after every five 1s in a row in the content, the sender says an extra 0, and the receiver takes it out again, so the content never looks like a flag."
      }
    }
  ],
  "inputs": [
    { "name": "byte", "label": { "zh": "队首", "en": "Next byte" } },
    { "name": "last", "label": { "zh": "末字节", "en": "Last byte" } },
    { "name": "send", "label": { "zh": "发送", "en": "Send" } }
  ],
  "outputs": [{ "name": "next", "label": { "zh": "下一个", "en": "Next" } }],
  "pulls": { "input": "byte", "next": "next", "last": "last" },
  "wires": { "out": [{ "name": "line", "label": { "zh": "出线", "en": "Wire out" } }] },
